From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lawnchair Mods v2 <mods@lawnchair>
Date: Mon, 12 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add mod shortcuts to Lawnchair long-press menu

Adds 6 new SystemShortcut factories registered in LawnchairLauncher:
  - Advanced Permissions (appops via su)
  - Share App (base APK or merged .apks)
  - Install to Another User (pm install-existing)
  - Show Data Dir (open /data/data/<pkg> in MiXplorer/MT Manager)
  - Show App Dir (open APK install path in file manager)
  - Select (multi-select with Merge/Share/Uninstall)
---
 10 files changed

